    "severity": {
      "maximum": null
    },
    "status": "gap",
    "split": "dev",
    "notes": "A second page looks like a wholly different manifest: every tool of page 1 reads as removed and every tool of page 2 as added. The correct behaviour is NO detection at all (pages must be accumulated before hashing), so maximum is null and the case is a gap: today it emits tool_added/tool_removed at low. Pagination is unused in the current corpus (zero nextCursor in four months) but the blind spot is real; manifest v2 accumulates pages before hashing."
